// A minor pentatonic, box 2 (index at fret 7) up and down, then box 3 (index at fret 10, back to 9 on string 3) up and down, in 8ths.
// lf 2 = index (1), lf 3 = middle (2), lf 4 = ring (3), lf 5 = pinky (4).
\title "A minor pentatonic, boxes 2 and 3"
\tempo 100
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
